<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharan forces are holding the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces have taken Buurhakaba after heavy fighting in the Bay region, and opposition fighters have seized a third town in just over a week. Ethiopia is reported to be supporting al-Shabab militants in the Southwest State and is planning a troop withdrawal from Somalia as fighting intensifies at home. Somalia is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case, deepening defence ties with Pakistan to acquire JF-17 fighter jets, and arranging the release of four Pakistani sailors freed from pirates. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOd3lJXzQxTzU4VHM3YmRyOXg5dXN4dDBmUzVzYjhKX1NkM0ppeFdCYVlkcVpWS0dMa3FxUV9OdjdUWnNPSXRGU3BnQVVxRGM1UEFpclVnTzNkWXBoNEhJdC1saEVxMEdSb19fOHdaSlR1QWFMbDNoWFc4cEVLaDVaMXNEQ3VvVnF6a2szb21HZDE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shabelle Media Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQRXlpSE85NEw0bF9RZjV0d0dyT2dPWGZsUVJrUU4yUkpVaGlxcEdGMDVXTE14WFFjWW01SnlPYU9EZ09JcUN2TVBiVXZoVUVYOEdwU0h1VDZXTEJseUl2ekpLMTdQckdBWG5uVm54RWhzQ0tIYkFtVHIwaS1mMnlvaldqay11bUM2R0VoQk1uRGNNZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Horseed Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNQ1hTbnRWNFFXUEdZaldjd0lmeHlRXzUtQ3dQeDd0Q0d2bUhVdElzY0ptRnQ4NzRWS3ZMYnFEVGo4ZDI1a2tKSU9aUklLcDFlb3pXQnJfamlxak5MdnlXZVhBMjlQanF0dzUtSnJfU2x6OGhpd0c4bEpleXFuX2xFaFhxZzRFMmhSOTR4bzZVbXNVc1VBcXVHRFlwYk5CTkdHWmJCcVpiY0NTYWZkWkFfUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;FTL Somalia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQVzNzMFM1VFJkeVJDd0JfMGtKVGdaaTlHT2Y3ZFB2VkVuXzFubzFGQUU2SjBxaXpxNFl3eHJxUmFTd0hnMUNCZmtUcl9LRlkyWXZ4YjZ6cG9tZUsyektESGpfWkhCLWJfZFJ2dDN4Q3N4Vl84T3ZkbENxSUo3d1RvZjRU